WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.244 --> 00:00:04.380
As the year 12.021 slowly comes to an end,

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:12.206
we present to you the 12.022
human era calendar, Eons edition.

00:00:12.206 --> 00:00:13.223
As always,

00:00:13.223 --> 00:00:16.900
we're adding 10.000 years to the regular
calendar to represent the human era

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.190
and include all cultures around the world,

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:22.390
but this year we're expanding the scope
beyond humanity

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:27.098
to showcase forgotten animals and plants
from all across the phanerozoic Eon

00:00:27.098 --> 00:00:33.073
like giant armored fish scythe lizards or
giant sloths, on 12 elaborate pages.

00:00:33.073 --> 00:00:37.489
Witness how multicellular life has
persisted for over half a billion years,

00:00:37.489 --> 00:00:43.310
surviving asteroid impacts, volcanoes and
frozen oceans and of course pandemics.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:46.632
In the end, life er... finds a way,

00:00:46.632 --> 00:00:49.562
and we want to celebrate that.

00:00:49.562 --> 00:00:54.703
You can get the very shiny high quality
limited edition now, until we set out and

00:00:54.703 --> 00:00:59.340
then never again, to support what we do on
this channel, to fill the void

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:02.855
in your soul, or just to have
something beautiful to look at.

00:01:02.855 --> 00:01:06.385
As every year, we also have bundles and
special calendar deals

00:01:06.385 --> 00:01:11.013
with some of your favourite products.

00:01:11.013 --> 00:01:15.375
Thank you so much to all of the thousands
of birds who get the calendar every year,

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:19.696
you enable us to create videos
and to publish them for free for everyone.

00:01:19.696 --> 00:01:24.924
We wish you a happy year 12.022.

00:01:24.924 --> 00:01:32.185
[Music]

00:01:32.185 --> 00:01:37.041
[Music]

